flowchart TB
  C[tools/call action service params<br/>Authorization: Bearer capability] --> J{"ES256 signature by Sentinel Guard (its JWKS, kid),<br/>iss sentinel-guard, aud = sentinel-action,<br/>not expired, has jti and request_id?"}
  J -->|no| X1[refuse · invalid capability token]
  J -->|yes| B{claims.action = this tool and<br/>claims.target = service?}
  B -->|no| X3[refuse · capability covers other action/target]
  B -->|yes| P{every parameter = the approved<br/>claims.change value? size, replicas}
  P -->|no| X2[refuse · capability approves size=40, not size=60]
  P -->|yes| D{dry_run?}
  D -->|yes| OKD[validated · capability NOT redeemed · no ops call]
  D -->|no| R{redeem at the guard<br/>POST /v1/capabilities/spend}
  R -->|409| X4[refuse · capability already used]
  R -->|unreachable or error| X5[refuse · Sentinel Guard unavailable<br/>fails closed]
  R -->|200| OPS[POST service /ops/action] --> AUD[JSON audit line with jti and guard request<br/>executed: true]
  classDef bad fill:#fdecea,stroke:#b42318,color:#1d1d1b
  classDef ok fill:#e7f5ee,stroke:#1f7a4d,color:#1d1d1b
  class X1,X2,X3,X4,X5 bad
  class OPS,AUD,OKD ok
